            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yep, you are completely right. `noice.nvim` introduces it.\r\nIf I disable it in `noice` it works correctly. Thanks for your help! ❤️ \r\n```\r\n      {\r\n        filter = {\r\n          event = 'msg_show',\r\n          kind = 'echomsg',\r\n          find = 'No textobject',\r\n        },\r\n        opts = { skip = true },\r\n      },\r\n\r\n```",
